    "Id": "chassisdef_battlemaster_BLR-QS4",
    "Name": "BattleMaster",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Assault Ballistic Support. The BLR-4 is specialized in cooking your enemies out of their mechs. The revolutionary Double Autocannons can unload more inferno rounds than any other Autocannons on the market.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>",
