      "unit_mechtool"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Assault Ballistic Support",
  "YangsThoughts": "Well, if you ever wanted to see a mech burst into flames despite having a fully functioning cooling system, then point this thing at them. Those \"double ACs\" are a lot less flexable than UACs, but their one upside is that they can use normal AC rounds, which in this case means inferno rounds. Just be careful with letting the newbie pilots in the cockpit, since a \"misfire\" will damage those guns.",
